The selected source row's centroid, frontage or access point is not guaranteed
to be a surveyed building entrance or a verified apartment coordinate. Shared G-NAF ancestry with
index inputs limits independence. See docs/evaluation/registry/au.md for preparation and
coverage exclusions.
